## 🏆 Game Scores

### Supabase Table
```sql
CREATE TABLE game_scores (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  game_slug TEXT NOT NULL,
  score INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (score >= 0),
  achieved_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);
ALTER TABLE game_scores ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Users insert own scores" ON game_scores FOR INSERT WITH CHECK (auth.uid() = user_id);
CREATE POLICY "Anyone reads scores" ON game_scores FOR SELECT USING (true);
```

### Anti-Cheat (Basic)
- Score `CHECK (score >= 0)` constraint in DB
- Max score sanity check in app (e.g., `score <= 999999`)
- No server-side validation for now (personal site, low stakes)

### Cost: $0 — scores are tiny rows

