## 💰 Monetization (Future — No Infra Added Yet)

### Do NOT add monetization infra until actively needed
When the time comes, acceptable $0-baseline options:
- **Ko-fi / Buy Me a Coffee**: External link — $0 infra, they handle payments
- **Stripe**: No monthly fee, only % per transaction — add only when first product exists
- **GitHub Sponsors**: $0 — add a FUNDING.yml to repo

### Rules
- Never add a payment processor "just in case"
- Never add a subscription management service preemptively
- When adding Stripe: use Stripe's webhook → Supabase Edge Function (verify free tier first)
- Keep monetization features behind a feature flag initially

